nativeDocumentation:
Allocate a handle for a missing-endpoint plan. Awaiting it starts control
     new-session and binds the same connection. The handle owns its new client;
     it never acquires ownership of the daemon.

Validate native workspace values without contacting tmux or reading the
   filesystem. Relative directories resolve against the document directory;
   only declared variables participate in expansion.

